E.APPLICANTS MUST AGREE IN WRITING TO: AUTHORIZE THE CITY, ITS
AGENTS AND EMPLOYEES TO SEEK ANY ADDITIONAL INFORMATION
AND REGULATIONS GOVERNING THE LICENSE REQUESTED; VERIFYTHAT
INFORMATION CONTAINED IN THE APPLICATION IS TRUE AND CORRECT,
ANDRELEASE, INDEMNIFY AND HOLD HARMLESS THE CITY, ITS AGENTS AND
EMPLOYEES FROM ANY AND ALL CLAIMS ARISING AS A RESULT OF THE
